2. This port
------------------------------------------------------------------
Name:        ReBongo (Unofficial NeoForge Port)
Mod id:      bongo
Maintainer:  Big_Jls
Assistance:  DeepSeek-v4.1-Flash-1017 (porting/code assistance)
Source:      https://github.com/Big-Jls/rebongo
License:     Apache License 2.0 (for the modifications in this port)

Changes made for this port:
- Ported the Forge 1.20.1-era code base to Minecraft 26.2 / NeoForge
  (registration, networking payloads, data loading, rendering, commands).
- Restored the upstream mod id `bongo`, resource namespaces `assets/bongo`
  and `data/bongo`, and the `/bingo` command tree.
- Reworked advancement reset, statistic access, config handling and codec
  builders for the 26.2 API.
- Added TraderSpawnPatch so wandering traders can spawn during short rounds.
- Decompiled and recompiled sources were adjusted to compile against
  NeoForge 26.2.0.93 and LibX 26.2-8.0.0; see CHANGES.md for details.

